WEBVTT

1
00:01:17.291 --> 00:01:18.416
Nott. you bastard!

2
00:03:28.079 --> 00:03:31.954
PEENAK 5

3
00:04:03.453 --> 00:04:05.744
Toh. wait for me. wait!

4
00:04:05.828 --> 00:04:06.453
This way.

5
00:04:11.244 --> 00:04:12.536
Come on. guys. quick!

6
00:04:20.744 --> 00:04:23.201
Hello. bitch? Why are you calling me now?

7
00:04:24.243 --> 00:04:25.535
I'll send you my location.

8
00:04:26.285 --> 00:04:26.993
Okay.

9
00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:29.368
Over here.

10
00:04:31.035 --> 00:04:31.785
Move!

11
00:04:33.285 --> 00:04:35.451
- Damn. how'd it get here?
- He's here. move out.

12
00:04:48.410 --> 00:04:49.118
Shit!

13
00:04:51.868 --> 00:04:52.743
You okay?

14
00:04:59.659 --> 00:05:01.575
First. Balloon. are you alright?

15
00:05:01.659 --> 00:05:04.284
I'll kill everyone you love!

16
00:05:11.659 --> 00:05:13.034
Nott! Nott! Nott!

17
00:05:21.409 --> 00:05:22.617
Get in. everyone!

18
00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:23.534
- Aod!
- That's Aod!

19
00:05:23.909 --> 00:05:24.325
Come on. quick!

20
00:05:24.409 --> 00:05:25.617
Yes. go. go!

21
00:05:27.617 --> 00:05:29.492
First. Balloon. this way. quick!

22
00:05:30.616 --> 00:05:32.158
Damn fancy. I'm in a body wagon.

23
00:05:33.658 --> 00:05:35.283
Aod. what were you thinking?

24
00:05:36.449 --> 00:05:37.658
Aod. step on it!

25
00:05:55.449 --> 00:05:56.574
Let's rest here.

26
00:06:01.158 --> 00:06:04.865
We've come up this high.
Pee Nak can't follow us.

27
00:06:06.198 --> 00:06:08.907
But was that ghost really Nott's brother?

28
00:06:09.240 --> 00:06:10.573
Why was he so vicious?

29
00:06:10.948 --> 00:06:14.157
Right. Did we do something to him?

30
00:06:14.615 --> 00:06:16.615
Why would he want to kill all of us?

31
00:06:18.865 --> 00:06:21.740
Nott. tell us. what did you do?

32
00:06:22.032 --> 00:06:23.907
Why is he hunting us down?

33
00:06:29.615 --> 00:06:33.865
Because you're my friends.

34
00:06:52.614 --> 00:06:53.822
How many more sets left?

35
00:06:54.364 --> 00:06:55.989
Just two or three more and we're done.

36
00:06:59.447 --> 00:07:01.947
Novice. walk mindfully.

37
00:07:03.197 --> 00:07:04.989
Sorry. sir. I'm sorry.

38
00:07:06.447 --> 00:07:08.906
Novice Hunglay. where
are you rushing off to?

39
00:07:09.406 --> 00:07:12.780
Oh. someone's here to see you. Nott.

40
00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:14.697
in front of the chapel.

41
00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:16.822
Yes. thank you. novice.

42
00:07:17.322 --> 00:07:17.988
Yes.

43
00:07:23.405 --> 00:07:24.363
Who is it. novice?

44
00:07:24.447 --> 00:07:26.113
I don't know. sir.

45
00:07:26.197 --> 00:07:28.030
He's got a mean look.

46
00:07:39.447 --> 00:07:40.780
Are you here to see me?

47
00:07:59.529 --> 00:08:03.487
Did you forget me. little brother?

48
00:08:08.321 --> 00:08:09.112
Nin.

49
00:08:11.529 --> 00:08:13.529
I went to your old temple.

50
00:08:14.071 --> 00:08:16.529
The head monk said you left and moved here.

51
00:08:18.196 --> 00:08:18.861
Yes.

52
00:08:21.820 --> 00:08:23.820
You came to see me... what's wrong?

53
00:08:26.236 --> 00:08:28.111
Do I need a reason to come see you?

54
00:08:29.611 --> 00:08:31.611
You're the only family I've got.

55
00:08:32.986 --> 00:08:34.111
I've missed you so much.

56
00:08:35.486 --> 00:08:37.070
I really wanted to see you.

57
00:08:44.903 --> 00:08:48.486
And... how's Dad?

58
00:09:03.152 --> 00:09:04.152
He's doing fine.

59
00:09:11.152 --> 00:09:12.735
What's going on at the temple?

60
00:09:15.069 --> 00:09:18.735
It's Poy Sang Long festival in two days.

61
00:09:21.110 --> 00:09:25.819
It's a mass ordination ceremony
for novices and monks.

62
00:10:18.608 --> 00:10:19.275
Nin...

63
00:10:21.067 --> 00:10:21.858
What's wrong?

64
00:10:23.150 --> 00:10:24.150
No. it's nothing.

65
00:10:32.108 --> 00:10:33.899
I'll leave an ordination set here. okay?

66
00:10:34.399 --> 00:10:36.732
Yeah. I'll go shower first.

67
00:10:51.107 --> 00:10:52.482
Don't forget to inform us. alright?

68
00:10:53.232 --> 00:10:55.441
- Hurry up. okay?
- Dad.

69
00:10:55.524 --> 00:10:58.107
- Yes. thank you. Hurry up.
- Get up.

70
00:10:58.691 --> 00:11:00.191
Dad.

71
00:11:00.274 --> 00:11:01.274
- Who did that?
- That's cruel.

72
00:11:01.524 --> 00:11:02.524
Dad.

73
00:11:03.691 --> 00:11:06.482
Dad!

74
00:11:07.523 --> 00:11:08.606
Dad!

75
00:11:10.648 --> 00:11:12.148
Thank God you're safe.

76
00:11:51.147 --> 00:11:52.439
That poor kid.

77
00:11:56.272 --> 00:11:58.397
He wanted to become a novice for his dad.

78
00:12:02.022 --> 00:12:03.064
Such a pity...

79
00:12:04.939 --> 00:12:07.689
His father never got to
see him in yellow robes.

80
00:12:09.230 --> 00:12:10.980
Why did you do that?

81
00:12:11.064 --> 00:12:14.189
Call the cops on me. if
you suspect me that much.

82
00:12:17.813 --> 00:12:22.354
Someone like me... no matter where I am.

83
00:12:23.854 --> 00:12:26.729
no one trusts me. no one loves me.

84
00:12:27.604 --> 00:12:29.604
Not even my own brother.

85
00:12:34.813 --> 00:12:38.563
You dropped this at the crime scene.

86
00:12:41.229 --> 00:12:43.979
Yeah. I killed that brat's father.

87
00:12:44.063 --> 00:12:46.604
I did it with my own hands.

88
00:12:46.688 --> 00:12:47.688
Satisfied?

89
00:12:47.938 --> 00:12:49.645
Why did you do it?

90
00:12:50.937 --> 00:12:52.187
Why did you kill him?

91
00:12:52.270 --> 00:12:54.103
They loved each other. I didn't like it.

92
00:12:54.187 --> 00:12:55.770
You have to turn yourself in.

93
00:12:57.103 --> 00:12:58.978
No. I won't.

94
00:12:59.645 --> 00:13:01.603
I won't. I'm going to ordain.

95
00:13:04.145 --> 00:13:08.895
With blood on your hands. you can't ordain!

96
00:13:08.978 --> 00:13:10.062
You bastard!

97
00:13:21.687 --> 00:13:23.894
Nott. listen to me.

98
00:13:25.102 --> 00:13:28.477
If I get ordained.
I can become a decent man again.

99
00:13:30.519 --> 00:13:31.936
And if you keep quiet.

100
00:13:32.477 --> 00:13:34.019
no one will ever know.

101
00:13:42.894 --> 00:13:45.144
Don't make my hands
stain with blood again...

102
00:13:48.311 --> 00:13:49.352
...my little brother.

103
00:14:00.018 --> 00:14:01.643
"Thai Life Insurance invites you
to the annual merit event"

104
00:14:01.726 --> 00:14:03.310
"Poy Sang Long Festival
Wat Luang Nakhin. Chiang Mai"

105
00:14:23.518 --> 00:14:26.101
Bastard Nott. you betrayed me!

106
00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:28.101
Nin. no!

107
00:14:28.185 --> 00:14:29.351
Nin. no!

108
00:14:32.142 --> 00:14:34.392
- Move. move!
- Hurry up!

109
00:14:35.017 --> 00:14:38.017
Nin. stop! Nin. Turn yourself in!

110
00:14:38.100 --> 00:14:39.600
Nin. I'm begging you. please.

111
00:14:39.934 --> 00:14:41.100
- Stop it!
- You bastard!

112
00:14:45.600 --> 00:14:47.934
- Go. go. hurry!
- Move. get back!

113
00:14:48.017 --> 00:14:49.059
Stay away! Stay away!

114
00:14:49.934 --> 00:14:51.017
Stay away! Stay away!

115
00:14:52.850 --> 00:14:56.184
After that. no one ever saw Nin again.

116
00:14:57.392 --> 00:14:59.017
Maybe he's dead.

117
00:14:59.475 --> 00:15:01.725
That ghost looks exactly like him.

118
00:15:02.434 --> 00:15:06.183
Nott. you shouldn't have
reported your brother.

119
00:15:06.474 --> 00:15:10.974
Uh. I... I..

120
00:15:11.224 --> 00:15:12.516
You did the right thing.

121
00:15:13.224 --> 00:15:15.683
He's your brother. but
he's still a murderer.

122
00:15:17.599 --> 00:15:20.891
The guilty should pay for what they did.

123
00:15:23.391 --> 00:15:26.183
How long are we going
to run from this ghost?

124
00:15:30.766 --> 00:15:32.683
Damn! I've had enough!

125
00:15:33.266 --> 00:15:33.974
What is it?

126
00:15:34.058 --> 00:15:36.183
Four down. and we're still standing.

127
00:15:36.599 --> 00:15:38.098
This one's no different.

128
00:15:39.682 --> 00:15:40.307
Exactly.

129
00:15:42.057 --> 00:15:43.807
We're done running.

130
00:15:44.223 --> 00:15:47.765
From prey. we turn into the predators.

131
00:15:53.515 --> 00:15:57.432
- Nott! Nott! Nott!
- Nott! Nott!

132
00:16:04.932 --> 00:16:05.557
Look!

133
00:16:18.014 --> 00:16:21.097
You damn ghost!
Even up here you're still following me?

134
00:16:21.556 --> 00:16:22.222
Get down here!

135
00:16:22.639 --> 00:16:24.264
- Sis!
- Get down here!

136
00:16:24.472 --> 00:16:26.472
- Now!
- Let's go.

137
00:16:26.931 --> 00:16:28.847
- Get down here!
- Forget it. just go!

138
00:16:28.931 --> 00:16:30.306
Go on. we'll go ahead!

139
00:16:30.389 --> 00:16:31.597
Get out of here.

140
00:17:03.596 --> 00:17:05.013
How are you doing?

141
00:17:06.221 --> 00:17:07.638
Doing well. Luang Por.

142
00:17:08.221 --> 00:17:10.888
"Doing well" usually means not...

143
00:17:10.971 --> 00:17:12.638
Novice. manners.

144
00:17:13.263 --> 00:17:14.430
Sorry. Luang Por.

145
00:17:15.346 --> 00:17:18.095
So what brings you here?

146
00:17:19.012 --> 00:17:21.762
I'm here about my brother.

147
00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:25.970
I want to know if anyone found the body

148
00:17:26.054 --> 00:17:27.762
or my brother's remains?

149
00:17:28.762 --> 00:17:32.887
And what makes you sure that Nin is dead?

150
00:17:33.970 --> 00:17:35.012
Because...

151
00:17:37.345 --> 00:17:41.762
his spirit is out there.
killing everyone around me.

152
00:17:44.595 --> 00:17:47.554
If we can bring his body back
for a religious rite.

153
00:17:48.012 --> 00:17:50.387
I think it might finally set his soul free.

154
00:17:53.761 --> 00:17:56.053
We're just lost at this point

155
00:17:56.761 --> 00:18:00.553
but this seems the best start.

156
00:18:01.011 --> 00:18:02.344
from our experience.

157
00:18:02.678 --> 00:18:04.094
Even if it's not working.

158
00:18:04.844 --> 00:18:05.969
Shut it.

159
00:18:06.178 --> 00:18:08.719
Going there is dangerous. you know.

160
00:18:09.303 --> 00:18:11.761
We aren't safe anywhere

161
00:18:11.844 --> 00:18:14.094
not unless we get rid of Pee Nak's ghost.

162
00:18:15.469 --> 00:18:18.678
Can you help us subdue this spirit?

163
00:18:21.094 --> 00:18:25.343
I am a monk. My duty is
to show the way to Dharma.

164
00:18:26.093 --> 00:18:28.802
not to do battle with the supernatural.

165
00:18:29.802 --> 00:18:33.593
Prayers aren't meant to drive away ghosts.

166
00:18:34.677 --> 00:18:38.802
but to free the mind
from fear and delusion.

167
00:18:43.385 --> 00:18:44.593
I'm sore all over.

168
00:18:45.177 --> 00:18:47.135
This path leads to a sacred site

169
00:18:48.052 --> 00:18:49.927
where legends of the occult dwell.

170
00:18:51.218 --> 00:18:53.968
No one dares enter unless they have to.

171
00:18:54.052 --> 00:18:55.802
But do we have to?

172
00:19:03.217 --> 00:19:04.967
Yeah. I guess we do.

173
00:19:06.634 --> 00:19:09.551
Let's go. guys. Ignore this fruity.

174
00:19:11.259 --> 00:19:13.426
Like you're so manly. Balloon.

175
00:19:23.967 --> 00:19:27.592
This is the last lead we have on Nin.

176
00:19:32.217 --> 00:19:33.883
Then let's start right here.

177
00:19:33.966 --> 00:19:35.883
We'll split up and look around.

178
00:19:36.341 --> 00:19:38.883
Anyone finds anything. shout it out. okay?

179
00:20:03.341 --> 00:20:06.341
Hey. First. Let me ask you.

180
00:20:06.924 --> 00:20:09.049
Why'd you split off?
What are you looking for?

181
00:20:09.132 --> 00:20:12.632
Think about it. we're looking for clues.

182
00:20:13.799 --> 00:20:14.882
Clues?

183
00:20:14.965 --> 00:20:18.674
For four parts.
still nothing but this same bullshit.

184
00:20:28.924 --> 00:20:31.007
If you see anything strange.

185
00:20:31.882 --> 00:20:33.757
that's a clue.

186
00:20:34.465 --> 00:20:36.799
Strange equals a clue?

187
00:20:53.089 --> 00:20:54.548
- A clue!
- A clue!

188
00:20:55.214 --> 00:20:57.048
A clue! We got a clue!

189
00:20:57.131 --> 00:20:58.256
On my way. Clue!

190
00:21:02.131 --> 00:21:03.006
- Nott!
- Nott!

191
00:21:09.089 --> 00:21:10.006
- Nott!
- Nott!

192
00:21:10.381 --> 00:21:11.548
- Nott!
- Hold on.

193
00:21:11.631 --> 00:21:13.714
Nott. what is it?

194
00:21:13.798 --> 00:21:14.588
Nott.

195
00:21:17.213 --> 00:21:17.880
Hey!

196
00:21:18.297 --> 00:21:19.880
What. a clue?

197
00:21:20.797 --> 00:21:23.088
What clue? It's blood. you idiot!

198
00:21:23.547 --> 00:21:24.213
You okay. Nott?

199
00:21:24.797 --> 00:21:25.880
Blood!

200
00:21:27.255 --> 00:21:30.338
Every time Nott's like this.
a ghost shows up.

201
00:21:30.838 --> 00:21:32.255
Stop saying stupid crap.

202
00:21:32.422 --> 00:21:34.755
It's broad daylight.
No damn ghost's coming out.

203
00:21:47.005 --> 00:21:49.046
Your mouth is seriously cursed.

204
00:22:13.129 --> 00:22:15.004
I'll kill everyone you love.

205
00:22:18.879 --> 00:22:19.671
Nott

206
00:22:22.086 --> 00:22:22.753
Aod

207
00:22:24.461 --> 00:22:25.086
Mr. Toh!

208
00:22:38.795 --> 00:22:40.586
Balloon. what the hell is that thing?

209
00:22:41.253 --> 00:22:42.420
A dinosaur?

210
00:22:43.170 --> 00:22:45.503
Dino my ass. It's huge and long.

211
00:22:47.003 --> 00:22:48.836
Everyone. come on!

212
00:22:49.253 --> 00:22:51.170
Whoa. ready to go.

213
00:22:53.753 --> 00:22:55.127
Mr.Toh. Watch out!

214
00:22:55.794 --> 00:22:56.460
- Mr.Toh!
- Mr.Toh!

215
00:22:57.127 --> 00:22:57.960
Mr.Toh!

216
00:22:58.835 --> 00:22:59.710
Mr.Toh! Careful!

217
00:22:59.919 --> 00:23:01.085
- Run!
- Mr.Toh!

218
00:23:08.085 --> 00:23:10.044
Mr.Toh. hurry! Hurry!

219
00:23:13.252 --> 00:23:14.294
It's coming. Watch out!

220
00:23:18.752 --> 00:23:19.294
Nott!

221
00:23:25.252 --> 00:23:26.877
Everyone. run!

222
00:23:42.001 --> 00:23:43.043
How is everyone?

223
00:23:44.043 --> 00:23:45.043
What was that?

224
00:23:46.084 --> 00:23:47.168
I don't do it anymore.

225
00:23:48.376 --> 00:23:49.959
Didn't you say we'd fight?

226
00:23:50.251 --> 00:23:53.334
Pee Nak showed up.
you bolted like a 400-meter sprint.

227
00:23:54.543 --> 00:23:56.126
That was not running away.

228
00:23:56.209 --> 00:23:58.376
It's called a tactical retreat.

229
00:23:58.709 --> 00:24:01.168
We regroup. then think.

230
00:24:02.875 --> 00:24:04.250
Everyone okay?

231
00:24:05.292 --> 00:24:07.125
Hello. everyone.

232
00:24:14.542 --> 00:24:17.167
You all look like you've been to war.

233
00:24:17.250 --> 00:24:19.167
Not like you were searching for a body.

234
00:24:19.458 --> 00:24:22.500
Novice. maybe you should come with us.

235
00:24:22.875 --> 00:24:24.417
No thanks. I'd feel awkward.

236
00:24:27.750 --> 00:24:30.875
Everyone. besides Pee Nak's ghost.

237
00:24:32.125 --> 00:24:33.708
what was that creature?

238
00:24:36.499 --> 00:24:38.291
Based on the temple legend.

239
00:24:39.124 --> 00:24:42.124
that creature is probably a Makara.

240
00:24:43.124 --> 00:24:44.791
Makara?

241
00:24:46.832 --> 00:24:48.749
There's a legend that

242
00:24:49.791 --> 00:24:56.249
this place was once a battlefield
between the Naga.

243
00:24:56.916 --> 00:24:59.249
protector of Buddhism.

244
00:24:59.791 --> 00:25:01.957
and the Makara. a Himmapan beast.

245
00:25:02.624 --> 00:25:06.832
But the Makara grew jealous that

246
00:25:06.916 --> 00:25:09.291
the Naga was honored
as the symbol of Dharma.

247
00:25:09.831 --> 00:25:11.623
So it sought to defeat him.

248
00:25:12.498 --> 00:25:16.915
The Makara challenged the Naga
to a duel of powers.

249
00:25:20.498 --> 00:25:25.956
The Naga saw that continued fighting
would harm others.

250
00:25:26.248 --> 00:25:30.873
So he said. "If you can swallow me whole.

251
00:25:31.248 --> 00:25:35.415
I'll let you represent
Buddhism instead of me."

252
00:25:35.831 --> 00:25:37.706
The Makara accepted.

253
00:25:37.956 --> 00:25:40.706
It swallowed the Naga whole.

254
00:25:40.998 --> 00:25:43.955
But when it reached the Naga's head.

255
00:25:44.372 --> 00:25:48.414
the Naga grew more heads.
becoming a seven-headed.

256
00:25:48.955 --> 00:25:52.580
The Makara couldn't swallow the heads.

257
00:25:53.080 --> 00:25:57.205
It died with resentment and hatred.

258
00:25:57.955 --> 00:26:04.455
The Naga knew the Makara
couldn't let go of its grudge.

259
00:26:04.914 --> 00:26:10.497
So he used his own blood
to seal the Makara's spirit.

260
00:26:11.164 --> 00:26:13.914
Later. a shrine was built

261
00:26:14.872 --> 00:26:17.080
with the Makara spewing out the Naga.

262
00:26:18.371 --> 00:26:21.579
It symbolizes that the Makara
is like defilements.

263
00:26:22.121 --> 00:26:26.288
love. greed. anger. delusion.

264
00:26:27.246 --> 00:26:29.788
And the Naga is ourselves.

265
00:26:30.079 --> 00:26:34.371
If we cling to attachment and obsession.

266
00:26:34.829 --> 00:26:36.746
- we are like the Naga...
- Focus.

267
00:26:36.829 --> 00:26:38.579
held by the Makara.

268
00:26:39.288 --> 00:26:42.829
unable to escape suffering or let go.

269
00:26:43.704 --> 00:26:48.038
Luang Por. if the Makara was sealed.

270
