1110
01:31:09.923 --> 01:31:11.214
You bastard!

1111
01:31:13.506 --> 01:31:14.673
Come here!

1112
01:31:19.089 --> 01:31:21.464
How's that?

1113
01:31:26.131 --> 01:31:27.380
Always praying.

1114
01:31:27.963 --> 01:31:31.130
Feeding all those monks.

1115
01:31:33.172 --> 01:31:34.547
What about your dad?

1116
01:31:34.797 --> 01:31:36.588
Is your dad just rotting here?

1117
01:31:37.422 --> 01:31:38.588
Look at me.

1118
01:31:39.213 --> 01:31:40.088
Look!

1119
01:31:40.172 --> 01:31:41.838
Look at my face!

1120
01:31:42.255 --> 01:31:43.880
Think you're so cool?

1121
01:31:45.297 --> 01:31:47.047
I said look at me!

1122
01:31:47.588 --> 01:31:48.880
Look!

1123
01:31:52.255 --> 01:31:53.797
I'm your fucking father!

1124
01:31:57.297 --> 01:31:58.338
You prick!

1125
01:31:59.172 --> 01:32:01.837
I'm done. We're over. psycho!

1126
01:32:05.087 --> 01:32:06.254
What the hell are you doing?

1127
01:32:06.587 --> 01:32:07.671
Stay back.

1128
01:32:09.129 --> 01:32:11.337
You stole my girl. you die!

1129
01:32:11.421 --> 01:32:12.504
Stay away from what's mine.

1130
01:32:12.587 --> 01:32:14.754
