1131
01:32:14.837 --> 01:32:15.962
Mine! Mine! Mine!

1132
01:32:28.837 --> 01:32:30.754
Want to break up with me?

1133
01:32:34.545 --> 01:32:35.211
Bitch!

1134
01:33:36.294 --> 01:33:38.294
I'm a monk. I can carry it. It's fine.

1135
01:33:38.377 --> 01:33:40.752
When I was a novice. you carried mine.

1136
01:33:40.835 --> 01:33:41.794
Let me.

1137
01:33:41.876 --> 01:33:43.334
A monk can give orders.

1138
01:33:44.376 --> 01:33:46.834
Oh. oh. then...

1139
01:33:46.918 --> 01:33:48.418
- I'll help.
- Yes.

1140
01:33:48.793 --> 01:33:49.834
Help blow the candle.

1141
01:33:49.918 --> 01:33:50.543
Sure.

1142
01:33:54.418 --> 01:33:58.209
Happy Birthday to you...

1143
01:33:58.293 --> 01:33:59.418
Is that so funny?

1144
01:34:01.459 --> 01:34:02.251
Uh...

1145
01:34:03.626 --> 01:34:04.959
Stay composed.

1146
01:34:05.418 --> 01:34:06.626
Yes. Luang Pee.

1147
01:34:08.918 --> 01:34:10.376
Happy Birth...

1148
01:34:12.418 --> 01:34:13.876
Stay composed.

1149
01:34:14.293 --> 01:34:15.334
Don't laugh.

1150
01:34:19.625 --> 01:34:21.625
Why poop right now?

1151
01:34:24.750 --> 01:34:25.958
Get down. slowly.

1152
01:34:31.083 --> 01:34:32.750
Come see me when you're done.

1153
01:34:32.833 --> 01:34:33.500
Yes. sir.

1154
01:34:34.125 --> 01:34:35.917
Let me kiss your cheeks.

1155
01:34:53.957 --> 01:34:57.707
I'm bad because I only saw hate.

1156
01:34:58.082 --> 01:35:01.082
Even you. Nott. You hate me too.

1157
01:35:08.999 --> 01:35:10.832
I never hated you.

1158
01:35:12.207 --> 01:35:13.041
That's not true.

1159
01:35:13.874 --> 01:35:15.332
You hate me.

1160
01:35:15.666 --> 01:35:18.874
You betrayed me until I died like this.

1161
01:35:22.956 --> 01:35:24.665
I never hated you.

1162
01:35:28.873 --> 01:35:29.706
Liar!

1163
01:35:34.790 --> 01:35:35.373
Nott!

1164
01:35:35.456 --> 01:35:36.123
Nott!

1165
01:35:36.540 --> 01:35:37.206
Nak!

1166
01:35:41.540 --> 01:35:44.081
Nin. I'm the one who told the police.

1167
01:36:23.872 --> 01:36:27.580
If you're angry. be angry at me.

1168
01:36:28.497 --> 01:36:29.830
Not brother Nott.

1169
01:36:39.746 --> 01:36:40.538
Novice.

1170
01:36:43.413 --> 01:36:44.579
Novice. run!

1171
01:36:50.954 --> 01:36:51.746
Novice.

1172
01:36:53.413 --> 01:36:54.163
Novice.

1173
01:37:03.371 --> 01:37:04.078
Nott!

1174
01:37:05.953 --> 01:37:06.495
Novice.

1175
01:37:09.703 --> 01:37:10.745
Nott!

1176
01:37:12.120 --> 01:37:13.037
Nott!

1177
01:37:15.912 --> 01:37:16.620
You...

1178
01:37:26.037 --> 01:37:26.912
Why?

1179
01:37:28.620 --> 01:37:30.287
Even though I'm so vile.

1180
01:37:33.537 --> 01:37:34.495
Because you...

1181
01:37:37.245 --> 01:37:38.577
are my brother.

1182
01:38:02.536 --> 01:38:03.536
Finally...

1183
01:38:06.411 --> 01:38:08.161
I can protect you.

1184
01:38:10.911 --> 01:38:13.951
But I can't protect you from your karma.

1185
01:38:15.660 --> 01:38:17.826
From what you've done.

1186
01:38:22.701 --> 01:38:25.451
You have to face it yourself.

1187
01:38:33.451 --> 01:38:35.451
I'll never forget you.

1188
01:38:54.992 --> 01:38:56.075
Thank you...

1189
01:38:59.659 --> 01:39:00.784
My brother.

1190
01:39:10.825 --> 01:39:11.867
I love you.

1191
01:39:15.492 --> 01:39:17.200
I love you too.

1192
01:39:59.865 --> 01:40:06.073
(Praying)

1193
01:41:46.654 --> 01:41:47.320
Nott

1194
01:41:47.404 --> 01:41:47.945
Nott

1195
01:41:48.029 --> 01:41:50.154
How are you? Are you okay?

1196
01:41:50.237 --> 01:41:51.445
Does it hurt?

1197
01:41:51.529 --> 01:41:53.779
Nott. stay away from that killer.

1198
01:41:55.737 --> 01:41:56.862
Nott

1199
01:41:56.945 --> 01:41:58.279
Are you okay. Nott?

1200
01:41:58.904 --> 01:42:01.070
I... Are you alright. Nott?

1201
01:42:01.487 --> 01:42:02.445
Stay away!

1202
01:42:05.029 --> 01:42:08.944
Forget it. Sorry. It's over. right?

1203
01:42:09.028 --> 01:42:10.278
Nott. you okay?

1204
01:42:25.153 --> 01:42:26.486
My whole body pains.

1205
01:42:27.486 --> 01:42:29.444
You're so greedy. Yim.

1206
01:42:29.653 --> 01:42:31.611
Knowing it was Novice. but telling no one.

1207
01:42:33.319 --> 01:42:34.153
I'm sorry. guys.

1208
01:42:34.236 --> 01:42:36.528
Sorry. Sorry. Sorry.

1209
01:42:36.611 --> 01:42:39.153
I was just worried about him.

1210
01:42:39.903 --> 01:42:42.693
Think about it. If I told the truth.

1211
01:42:43.235 --> 01:42:46.485
Who knows what would happen to him. right?

1212
01:42:47.360 --> 01:42:49.527
May my accumulated merit

1213
01:42:49.610 --> 01:42:53.693
protect Nott and his friends

1214
01:42:54.360 --> 01:42:56.235
keeping them safe and sound

1215
01:42:56.693 --> 01:43:00.152
from the wrath of Pee Nak's spirit.

1216
01:43:02.360 --> 01:43:08.735
That I'm the cause of all this vengeance.

1217
01:43:16.817 --> 01:43:19.401
Yim. hear something?

1218
01:43:20.817 --> 01:43:23.567
Oh. nothing. I just...

1219
01:43:23.651 --> 01:43:26.067
heard you wishing for our safety.

1220
01:43:26.442 --> 01:43:27.567
That's all.

1221
01:43:36.026 --> 01:43:37.817
Don't you smile at me. Novice.

1222
01:43:40.692 --> 01:43:41.817
Anyway. Novice...

1223
01:43:43.026 --> 01:43:45.901
Sadhu! I'm making a merit.

1224
01:43:48.109 --> 01:43:49.066
Thank you.

1225
01:43:50.733 --> 01:43:51.608
Let's go.

1226
01:43:52.150 --> 01:43:52.691
Go.

1227
01:43:57.816 --> 01:44:01.525
Why didn't you tell Nin
that you didn't call the police?

1228
01:44:02.358 --> 01:44:06.025
Even if I did. he wouldn't believe me.

1229
01:44:06.983 --> 01:44:10.691
He only thought nobody loved him.

1230
01:44:11.900 --> 01:44:13.733
The truth that could stop him

1231
01:44:14.733 --> 01:44:18.066
was making him see his own wrongs.

1232
01:44:28.232 --> 01:44:32.065
Peary. aren't you gonna
help with the monk hood?

1233
01:44:32.149 --> 01:44:32.774
True.

1234
01:44:32.857 --> 01:44:35.440
I have to go settle something.

1235
01:44:35.774 --> 01:44:38.274
Share the merit with Nott for me.

1236
01:44:38.357 --> 01:44:38.940
Okay?

1237
01:44:39.524 --> 01:44:40.649
Sure. honey.

1238
01:44:40.732 --> 01:44:44.565
Go do your mission. We'll follow.

1239
01:44:44.982 --> 01:44:45.649
I'm going.

1240
01:44:45.732 --> 01:44:46.524
Okay.

1241
01:44:47.107 --> 01:44:49.024
Ouch. my life.

1242
01:44:49.982 --> 01:44:51.440
Won't make it past the next turn.

1243
01:44:51.524 --> 01:44:52.315
Alive?

1244
01:44:52.649 --> 01:44:53.482
Dead!

1245
01:44:55.774 --> 01:44:58.731
Bonus. let's go home.

1246
01:45:00.273 --> 01:45:01.773
Is Bonus this small now?

1247
01:45:02.481 --> 01:45:04.981
Don't tie it tight. She can't breathe.

1248
01:45:05.064 --> 01:45:07.023
Can you breathe. Bonus?

1249
01:45:07.106 --> 01:45:08.523
Isn't she dead?

1250
01:45:11.689 --> 01:45:13.064
- I'm going.
- Yeah.

1251
01:45:13.148 --> 01:45:14.689
Bye-bye then.

1252
01:45:14.773 --> 01:45:16.231
See ya. Peary.

1253
01:45:16.314 --> 01:45:17.606
Bye-bye. "Koat Kaprao"

1254
01:45:18.356 --> 01:45:19.314
Get out.

1255
01:45:21.398 --> 01:45:23.023
Come on. let's take a photo.

1256
01:45:23.106 --> 01:45:24.064
Take it for us.

1257
01:45:24.148 --> 01:45:25.273
Sure thing.

1258
01:45:25.773 --> 01:45:27.439
Right in the middle.

1259
01:45:27.523 --> 01:45:28.814
- With the sign?
- With the sign.

1260
01:45:28.898 --> 01:45:30.647
- Nice. Very nice.
- Come on.

1261
01:45:30.730 --> 01:45:31.938
Laugh for no reason.

1262
01:45:32.022 --> 01:45:32.772
Laughing.

1263
01:45:32.855 --> 01:45:33.855
- Natural! Natural!
- Natural!

1264
01:45:35.355 --> 01:45:38.480
Don't count. just click. Keep clicking.

1265
01:45:43.397 --> 01:45:44.647
Came out great.

1266
01:45:44.730 --> 01:45:45.397
Hey!

1267
01:45:48.147 --> 01:45:48.897
Beautiful.

1268
01:45:48.980 --> 01:45:50.438
Novice. don't be funny!

1269
01:45:50.938 --> 01:45:52.397
Novice. let me see.

1270
01:45:52.647 --> 01:45:53.397
Okay.

1271
01:45:53.855 --> 01:45:56.147
No matter how far you are.

1272
01:45:56.730 --> 01:45:59.188
Thai Life Insurance will find you.

1273
01:45:59.772 --> 01:46:03.854
Thai Life. Thai Life. Thai Life Insurance.

1274
01:46:04.771 --> 01:46:07.062
- Kiddee! I knew it!
- Yes.

1275
01:46:07.146 --> 01:46:09.521
How did you know we were here?

1276
01:46:10.229 --> 01:46:11.271
I called him myself.

1277
01:46:12.562 --> 01:46:13.687
For Nott's monk hood?

1278
01:46:13.771 --> 01:46:17.104
Yes. but I have something more important.

1279
01:46:18.062 --> 01:46:19.604
More important than that?

1280
01:46:19.687 --> 01:46:23.354
You know that life is full of uncertainty.

1281
01:46:23.896 --> 01:46:27.021
So I want you all to build some security.

1282
01:46:27.104 --> 01:46:29.854
As a guarantee for the ones you love.

1283
01:46:31.354 --> 01:46:32.979
Build security?

1284
01:46:33.062 --> 01:46:34.187
Who else do I love?

1285
01:46:35.521 --> 01:46:37.603
- It's just you left. Yim.
- Me?

1286
01:46:38.770 --> 01:46:39.853
You called him. why confused?

1287
01:46:40.270 --> 01:46:41.728
- Hello.
- Hello.

1288
01:46:41.811 --> 01:46:43.145
Here it is. Mr. Yim.

1289
01:46:43.228 --> 01:46:47.728
As we discussed.
I've prepared all the papers for you.

1290
01:46:47.936 --> 01:46:48.978
Thank you so much.

1291
01:46:49.103 --> 01:46:51.770
Just sign here and we're all set.

1292
01:46:52.020 --> 01:46:52.853
Sure.

1293
01:46:52.936 --> 01:46:53.811
Here you go.

1294
01:46:53.895 --> 01:46:54.770
Thanks.

1295
01:46:58.978 --> 01:47:01.311
- Okay. thank you very much.
- Thanks.

1296
01:47:02.353 --> 01:47:03.770
Now I can rest easy.

1297
01:47:04.311 --> 01:47:05.645
Totally easy.

1298
01:47:05.728 --> 01:47:06.561
Sign it and you can die now.

1299
01:47:06.645 --> 01:47:08.645
Yeah. Yim. just die.
So we can get the money.

1300
01:47:08.728 --> 01:47:11.685
Hey. I've only been in a few sequels.

1301
01:47:12.894 --> 01:47:13.602
Thank you.

1302
01:47:13.685 --> 01:47:15.310
Thank you as well.

1303
01:48:39.767 --> 01:48:41.850
It'd be nice if you stayed
here for the Lent.

1304
01:48:42.558 --> 01:48:45.392
Thamma Naganimit is like a home for you.

1305
01:48:46.350 --> 01:48:47.808
Remember. First?

1306
01:48:47.892 --> 01:48:50.308
When we first came. the chapel was scary.

1307
01:48:50.392 --> 01:48:51.850
It had that ruined vibe. right?

1308
01:48:53.182 --> 01:48:55.349
Renovated and stunning

1309
01:48:56.849 --> 01:48:59.349
Seeing this. do you want to ordain again?

1310
01:48:59.974 --> 01:49:02.141
Mr.Toh. take a break.

1311
01:49:03.391 --> 01:49:04.391
Go ahead. ordain. I won't.

1312
01:49:04.474 --> 01:49:06.807
This temple has too many rules.

1313
01:49:06.891 --> 01:49:07.474
Hey!

1314
01:49:08.682 --> 01:49:09.557
"Just a few."

1315
01:49:10.891 --> 01:49:11.766
I'm sorry.

1316
01:49:12.641 --> 01:49:13.766
Let's head inside.

1317
01:49:13.849 --> 01:49:14.432
Let's go.

1318
01:49:46.223 --> 01:49:49.348
Leaving something sacreds.
Don't you regret it?

1319
01:49:52.056 --> 01:49:55.223
This amulet has saved us many times.

1320
01:49:56.681 --> 01:50:01.014
This Naga amulet has been through so much.

1321
01:50:01.597 --> 01:50:06.389
Many eras. many ages. many lives.

1322
01:51:12.970 --> 01:51:15.762
But this time. it helped until it broke.

1323
01:51:16.970 --> 01:51:18.428
It must be time...

1324
01:51:20.428 --> 01:51:22.178
for it to rest.

1325
01:51:25.387 --> 01:51:28.762
So the legend of Pee Nak finally ends.

1326
01:51:29.970 --> 01:51:31.512
We've all been through it.

1327
01:51:33.137 --> 01:51:35.887
All of us? At the worst.

1328
01:51:35.970 --> 01:51:37.887
Go back to work. alright Mr.Toh?

1329
01:51:38.262 --> 01:51:38.928
Yes.

1330
01:51:40.012 --> 01:51:43.552
Everything happened. and not by chance.

1331
01:51:45.927 --> 01:51:47.511
Everyone we met.

1332
01:51:48.386 --> 01:51:50.386
Every event that occurred.

1333
01:51:51.969 --> 01:51:53.594
The pain we passed.

1334
01:51:56.427 --> 01:51:57.886
The joy we passed.

1335
01:51:58.927 --> 01:52:01.261
They all happened for a reason.

1336
01:52:01.927 --> 01:52:04.469
And they've shaped our lives
for days to come.

1337
01:52:05.386 --> 01:52:06.886
Our duty...

1338
01:52:08.469 --> 01:52:11.886
is to learn and grow from them.

1339
01:52:16.676 --> 01:52:20.218
Cravings lead to karma.

1340
01:52:21.926 --> 01:52:24.885
Karma leads to consequences.

1341
01:52:26.468 --> 01:52:29.801
In the end. if we don't let go.

1342
01:52:30.885 --> 01:52:34.760
Our lives will never find true peace.

1343
01:52:40.593 --> 01:52:42.468
Sadhu.

1344
01:53:31.674 --> 01:53:32.466
What?

1345
01:53:48.466 --> 01:53:49.091
Yim!

1346
01:53:50.258 --> 01:53:50.924
Guys!

1347
01:53:52.841 --> 01:53:54.841
- Watch out. everyone!
- Look!

1348
01:54:03.465 --> 01:54:05.215
Luang Pee. help us!

1349
01:54:12.548 --> 01:54:14.298
Are you really not gonna
end this. Director Mike?

1350
01:54:14.673 --> 01:54:16.007
No! Stay there!

1351
01:54:16.423 --> 01:54:18.757
The legend of Pee Nak isn't over.

1352
01:54:30.089 --> 01:54:30.797
Mirror.

1353
01:54:31.631 --> 01:54:32.464
So what do I change?

1354
01:54:32.547 --> 01:54:34.464
I feel sorry for him. like...

1355
01:54:34.547 --> 01:54:37.172
Yeah. a bit more. Okay. that works.

1356
01:54:37.422 --> 01:54:39.672
Yeah. feel it. Like a brother.

1357
01:54:39.756 --> 01:54:41.964
Okay. okay. Good. very good.

1358
01:54:42.964 --> 01:54:44.922
I have to take Bonus home.

1359
01:54:45.297 --> 01:54:47.506
And settle something first.

1360
01:54:47.714 --> 01:54:49.172
Share the meri... merit with...

1361
01:54:49.464 --> 01:54:50.297
Take!

1362
01:54:50.756 --> 01:54:51.672
Your neck hurts. right?

1363
01:54:51.756 --> 01:54:54.047
Pretending to hurt? Wrong.

1364
01:54:55.797 --> 01:54:58.381
Share the me... merit with Nott.

1365
01:54:59.131 --> 01:54:59.714
Take!

1366
01:54:59.797 --> 01:55:00.381
Anu what?

1367
01:55:00.464 --> 01:55:01.547
What "anu"?

1368
01:55:01.631 --> 01:55:02.172
Anusawari?

1369
01:55:02.256 --> 01:55:03.713
Anumodhana...

1370
01:55:05.421 --> 01:55:08.130
Leaving something "splashed".
Don't you regret?

1371
01:55:08.213 --> 01:55:09.005
Take!

1372
01:55:09.088 --> 01:55:10.380
- Sacred!
- Splashed.

1373
01:55:10.463 --> 01:55:11.713
If it's splashed. go dry it.

1374
01:55:14.546 --> 01:55:17.088
Should we enter the chapel?
Let's look inside.

1375
01:55:17.380 --> 01:55:18.838
You first. Novice.

1376
01:55:19.463 --> 01:55:21.421
It's alright. go ahead.

1377
01:55:21.963 --> 01:55:23.088
You can't walk?

1378
01:55:23.171 --> 01:55:24.338
- I can't.
- Then how are you walking?

1379
01:55:24.421 --> 01:55:25.338
No walking.

1380
01:55:27.421 --> 01:55:29.796
Ow! I can't take it anymore!

1381
01:55:30.588 --> 01:55:32.421
- Four ghosts. we still can...
- Cut!

1382
01:55:32.796 --> 01:55:34.671
The lights flickered. I knew it. Scared me.

1383
01:55:34.963 --> 01:55:36.046
You are bit too loud.

1384
01:55:37.129 --> 01:55:38.920
And where will we get Naga blood?

1385
01:55:39.462 --> 01:55:40.129
There.

1386
01:55:41.879 --> 01:55:43.962
So... stupid.

1387
01:55:45.795 --> 01:55:46.879
- Cut!
- Cut.

1388
01:55:46.962 --> 01:55:49.004
This one guy. when
he's stuck. he just nods.

1389
01:55:49.087 --> 01:55:50.170
So stupid!

1390
01:55:53.587 --> 01:55:55.129
Yes. if it's enough.

1391
01:55:56.045 --> 01:55:57.545
- Not letting me speak?
- Not yet?

1392
01:55:57.629 --> 01:55:59.920
Didn't let me say a word.

1393
01:56:00.545 --> 01:56:02.670
- Let me play too.
- Calm down.

1394
01:56:03.920 --> 01:56:06.129
Concentrate. concentrate.

1395
01:56:09.254 --> 01:56:10.503
Shit. it didn't.

1396
01:56:10.586 --> 01:56:12.544
Damn. wrong side.

1397
01:56:13.336 --> 01:56:14.919
First. what did you bring?

1398
01:56:15.961 --> 01:56:17.461
Cut. cut. cut. cut.

1399
01:56:18.003 --> 01:56:19.253
Aim James wants to play.

1400
01:56:19.336 --> 01:56:20.461
Aim James wants to play.

1401
01:56:21.044 --> 01:56:22.586
Aim James. you're ruining the mood.

1402
01:56:27.003 --> 01:56:27.836
You bastard!

1403
01:56:27.919 --> 01:56:29.419
You hit my brother. bitch.

1404
01:56:36.628 --> 01:56:37.711
I give up.

1405
01:56:44.252 --> 01:56:45.002
Shit!

1406
01:56:45.085 --> 01:56:45.752
What?

1407
01:56:46.085 --> 01:56:47.418
Always me. dammit.

1408
01:56:49.293 --> 01:56:51.127
Where are my glasses?

1409
01:56:51.210 --> 01:56:54.252
Look. they're broken.
I'll buy you new ones.

1410
01:57:01.127 --> 01:57:02.293
You okay?

1411
01:57:05.002 --> 01:57:08.002
I wanted to play too. I'm lost.

1412
01:57:08.085 --> 01:57:09.585
Dammit. every single time.

1413
01:57:11.168 --> 01:57:14.752
(Praying)

1414
01:57:33.167 --> 01:57:35.959
Sadhu! Sadhu!

1415
01:57:36.501 --> 01:57:43.459
(Praying)

1416
01:57:44.334 --> 01:57:48.834
(Praying)

1417
01:57:51.666 --> 01:57:53.458
You think fucking a Nak

1418
01:57:54.708 --> 01:57:56.416
right before his ordination...

1419
01:57:57.625 --> 01:57:59.291
can be cleansed with a monk's robe?

1420
01:58:01.416 --> 01:58:02.458
I'll be your hell.

1421
01:58:04.000 --> 01:58:05.500
haunting your every step.

1422
01:58:08.000 --> 01:58:10.875
A lustful soul like you
can never be a monk.
